Problem: Find All Anagrams in a String (LC 438)

Pattern: Fixed Size Sliding Window + Frequency Array

Approach:

If p.length() > s.length(), return an empty vector.
Create two frequency arrays of size 26:
freq1 for string p
freq2 for the current window in string s
Fill both frequency arrays for the first window of size p.length().
If both frequency arrays are equal, store index 0.
Slide the window one character at a time:
Remove the outgoing character from freq2.
Add the incoming character to freq2.
If both frequency arrays match, store the starting index of the current window.
Return the answer vector.

Time Complexity: O(n)

Space Complexity: O(1)